@startuml
title Flujo 3 · Rotación de clave (ERC-734)

actor Admin as Adm
participant "Key Manager\n(ERC-734)" as KM

Adm -> KM : addKey(newKey, MANAGEMENT_KEY,\n keyType, weight)
KM -> KM : Verifica umbral actual para gestión
KM --> Adm : KeyAdded
Adm -> KM : (opcional) ajustar pesos/umbrales
KM --> Adm : ThresholdChanged
Adm -> KM : removeKey(oldKey, MANAGEMENT_KEY)
KM --> Adm : KeyRemoved
@enduml
